⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
328 calories 32g protein (for the entire pint, toppings included)

Peanut Butter Cup Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 140 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free @fairlife Milk
- 40-45g @Lakanto Monk Fruit Sweetener
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 8g (½ tbsp) Peanut Butter
- 16g (2 tbsp) @PBfit
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- 17g chopped Peanut Butter Cups
328 cal 27g C, 11g F, 32g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if powdery
5. Top with the chopped up PB Cups

